return ['domain'=>'presspermit-pro','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'PublishPress Permissions Pro 4.8.1','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-04-02T18:54:49+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01 19:50+0000','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['PublishPress Permissions Pro'=>'PublishPress Permissions Pro','https://publishpress.com/permissions'=>'https://publishpress.com/permissions','PublishPress Permissions allows you to enable or deny access to posts, pages, categories, tags and more.'=>'PublishPress 權限允許您啟用或拒絕對文章、頁面、分類、標籤等的訪問。','PublishPress'=>'PublishPress','https://publishpress.com/'=>'https://publishpress.com/','Should pages with privacy status "premium" require set_pages_premium and edit_premium_pages capabilities? If so, you can %1$sassign a status-specific Page Editor role%2$s or %3$sadd the capabilities directly to a role%4$s.'=>'隱私狀態為「高級」的頁面是否需要設置 set_pages_premium 和 edit_premium_pages 的能力？如果是，您可以 %1$s指派一個狀態特定的頁面編輯角色%2$s 或 %3$s直接將能力添加到角色中%4$s。','Note: Workflow sequence and branching for pre-publication is configured %son a separate screen%s'=>'注意：預發布的工作流程序列和分支在 %son a separate screen%s 中配置。','Additional settings provided by the %s module.'=>'由 %s 模組提供的其他設置。','Note: If you deactive, re-entry of the license key will be required for re-activation.'=>'注意：如果您停用，重新輸入許可密鑰將需要重新啟用。','If enabled, custom group membership is applied network-wide (though role assignments are still site-specific).'=>'如果啟用，自定義群組成員資格將在整個網絡中應用（儘管角色指派仍然是特定於網站的）。','Can create network-wide permission groups'=>'可以創建網絡範圍的權限群組','If group editing is allowed, can also modify network group membership'=>'如果允許群組編輯，還可以修改網絡群組成員資格','This feature will control direct URL access to files in /uploads/ folder. By default, files are blocked if they are attached to a post which the user can\'t view.'=>'此功能將控制對 /uploads/ 資料夾中檔案的直接 URL 訪問。默認情況下，若檔案附加在用戶無法查看的文章上，則將被阻止。','File Access on multisite installations will require the following rules to be inserted above the stock ms-files.php rules in the %1$smain .htaccess file%2$s:'=>'在多網站安裝中，檔案訪問將需要將以下規則插入到 %1$smain .htaccess 文件%2$s 的 ms-files.php 標準規則之上：','But your .htaccess is missing or not writeable!'=>'但您的 .htaccess 檔案缺失或不可寫！','.htaccess needs to be updated to include these rules.'=>'.htaccess 需要更新以包括這些規則。','.htaccess file has all required rules.'=>'.htaccess 檔案擁有所有所需規則。','These rules will not be inserted automatically.  You are responsible for editing .htaccess and later removing the rules if the functionality is no longer desired.'=>'這些規則不會自動插入。您需要負責編輯 .htaccess 並在不再需要該功能時刪除這些規則。','Note that an additional rule will need to be added with each new site. %1$sTo eliminate this requirement, research "WordPress remove ms-files".%2$s'=>'注意，每新增一個網站需要添加一條額外的規則。 %1$s要消除此要求，請研究「WordPress remove ms-files」。%2$s','You will need to manually restore the .htacces file to default contents if anything goes wrong. Proceed?'=>'如果出現任何問題，您將需要手動將 .htaccess 檔案恢復為默認內容。繼續嗎？','Update .htaccess now'=>'立即更新 .htaccess','only for sites with protected files'=>'僅適用於有受保護檔案的網站','for all sites'=>'適用於所有網站','NONE: remove Permissions rules'=>'無：移除權限規則','Since the plugin is not network-activated, you will need to modify the .htaccess file manually, inserting a RewriteRule as shown above for each site which needs file filtering.'=>'由於此外掛未在網絡上啟用，您需要手動修改 .htaccess 檔案，為每個需要檔案過濾的網站插入如上所示的 RewriteRule。','This extends the File Access feature to files that are not attached to any post. This will not apply to user who have the edit_private_files or pp_list_all_files capability.'=>'這將檔案存取功能擴展到未附加於任何文章的檔案。這不適用於具備 edit_private_files 或 pp_list_all_files 權限的用戶。','Make attached files unreadable to users who do not have the edit_private_files or pp_list_all_files capability.'=>'使附加檔案對於沒有 edit_private_files 或 pp_list_all_files 權限的用戶不可讀。','Improve Media Library performance by disabling file filtering for thumbnails (size specified in Settings > Media).'=>'通過禁用縮圖的檔案過濾來改善媒體庫的性能（大小在設定 > 媒體中指定）。','On some sites, an additional redirect is required to correctly deliver protected files. Leave this disabled for better performance if possible.'=>'在某些網站上，可能需要額外的重定向才能正確提供受保護的檔案。如果可能，請將此功能禁用以獲取更好的性能。','The File Access feature uses an %1$s.htaccess%2$s file located at %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s. Normally no action is needed, but clicking the button below will update the URL keys (at next site access) that protect the files.'=>'檔案存取功能使用位於 %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s 的 %1$s.htaccess%2$s 檔案。通常不需要任何操作，但點擊下面的按鈕將更新保護檔案的 URL 鍵（在下次訪問網站時）。','The File Access feature uses an %1$s.htaccess%2$s file located at %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s. Normally no action is needed, but clicking the button below will update the URL keys that protect the files.'=>'檔案存取功能使用位於 %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s 的 %1$s.htaccess%2$s 檔案。通常不需要任何操作，但點擊下面的按鈕將更新保護檔案的 URL 鍵。','Best practice is to access the above url periodically (using your own cron service) to prevent long-term bookmarking of protected files.'=>'最佳實踐是定期訪問上述 URL（使用您自己的計劃任務服務），以防止長期將受保護的檔案加入書籤。','Supply a custom key which will enable a support url to regenerate file access keys.  Then execute the url regularly (using your own cron service) to prevent long-term bookmarking of protected files.'=>'提供自定義密鑰，這將使支援 URL 能夠重新生成檔案存取密鑰。然後定期執行該 URL（使用您自己的計劃任務服務），以防止長期將受保護的檔案加入書籤。','File Access can also protect files uploaded by FTP or other manual file copy, but does not detect them automatically. Click the button below to scan your uploads folder for files to protect.'=>'檔案存取也可以保護透過 FTP 或其他手動檔案複製上傳的檔案，但不會自動檢測它們。點擊下面的按鈕掃描您的上傳資料夾以保護檔案。','Invalid file filtering key argument.'=>'無效的檔案過濾密鑰參數。','Please configure File Access options!'=>'請配置檔案存取選項！','The wp-content folder cannot be relocated outside the main WordPress folder.'=>'wp-content 資料夾不能移動到 WordPress 主資料夾之外。','Files linked in post content must be in %1$s (or a subfolder of it). If you move files, consider using a %2$s search and replace plugin%3$s to update those URLs.'=>'在文章內容中鏈接的檔案必須位於 %1$s（或其子資料夾中）。如果您移動檔案，請考慮使用 %2$s 搜尋和替換外掛%3$s 來更新這些 URL。','File Access can also protect files uploaded by FTP or other manual processes, but does not detect them automatically. This utility can find and protect any uploaded files.'=>'檔案存取也可以保護透過 FTP 或其他手動過程上傳的檔案，但不會自動檢測它們。此工具可以查找並保護任何上傳的檔案。','To run this utility by cron task or other direct request, use the following URL:'=>'要通過計劃任務或其他直接請求運行此工具，請使用以下 URL：','To run this utility by direct URL, set a file filtering regen key on Permissions Settings'=>'要通過直接網址運行此工具，請在權限設定中設置文件過濾再生鍵','Note: Direct access to uploaded file attachments cannot be filtered because your WP_CONTENT_DIR is not in the WordPress branch.'=>'注意：由於您的 WP_CONTENT_DIR 不在 WordPress 分支中，無法過濾對上傳文件附件的直接訪問。','The operation was terminated due to an invalid configuration.'=>'操作因配置無效而終止。','Checking %s posts / pages...'=>'檢查 %s 篇文章 / 頁面...','%1$s skipping unfilterable file in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s 跳過 %2$s "%3$s" 中不可過濾的文件:%4$s %5$s','%1$s skipping missing file in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s 跳過 %2$s "%3$s" 中缺失的文件:%4$s %5$s','%1$sNew attachment in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s 新附件在 %2$s "%3$s" 中:%4$s %5$s','%s linked uploads were found in your post / page content.'=>'%s 個鏈接的上傳文件已在您的文章 / 頁面內容中找到。','%s attachment records were added to the database.'=>'%s 條附件記錄已添加到數據庫。','All linked uploads are already registered as attachments.'=>'所有鏈接的上傳文件已作為附件註冊。','Statuses enabled here are available as Visibility options for post publishing. Affected posts become inaccessable without a corresponding status-specific role assignment.'=>'此處啟用的狀態可作為文章發布的可見性選項。受影響的文章將無法訪問，除非有相應的狀態特定角色分配。','Statuses enabled here are available in the editor as additional steps between Draft and Published.'=>'此處啟用的狀態在編輯器中可用作草稿與已發布之間的額外步驟。','Statuses alter your content\'s accessibility by imposing additional capability requirements.'=>'狀態通過施加額外的能力要求來改變您內容的可訪問性。','Enable Custom Capabilities by toggling the link below status name. If enabled, non-Editors will need a corresponding %ssupplemental role%s to edit posts of that status.'=>'通過切換狀態名稱下方的鏈接來啟用自定義能力。如果啟用，非編輯者將需要相應的 %ssupplemental role%s 來編輯該狀態的文章。','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, %sworkflow is configured%s to make the Publish button increment the post to the next workflow status permitted.'=>'對於無法發布的用戶的文章編輯，%s工作流程已配置%s，使發布按鈕將文章遞增到下個允許的工作流程狀態。','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, %sworkflow is configured%s to make the Publish button escalate the post to the highest-ordered workflow status permitted.'=>'對於無法發布的用戶的文章編輯，%s工作流程已配置%s，使發布按鈕將文章提升到允許的最高工作流程狀態。','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, the Publish button will escalate the post to the highest-order status permitted to the user.'=>'對於無法發布的用戶的文章編輯，發布按鈕將把文章提升到該用戶允許的最高狀態。','Please enable the PublishPress %sStatuses feature%s.'=>'請啟用 PublishPress %s狀態功能%s。','Note that the Post Type itself will also need to have %sPermissions%s enabled.'=>'注意，文章類型本身也需要啟用 %s權限%s。','To disable custom visibility statuses, first re-assign posts to a different status.'=>'要禁用自定義可見性狀態，請先將文章重新分配到不同的狀態。','Note, this only applies if the role definition includes the pp_moderate_any capability'=>'注意，這僅適用於角色定義包括 pp_moderate_any 能力的情況','Create or edit custom Privacy or Workflow statuses.'=>'創建或編輯自定義隱私或工作流程狀態。','Create or edit custom Privacy statuses.'=>'創建或編輯自定義隱私狀態。','Extra Roles created as a type-specific copy of this role will enable assignment of specified custom statuses.'=>'作為此角色的特定類型副本創建的額外角色將允許指定的自定義狀態的分配。','Editors do not need status-specific editing capabilities for workflow posts (Assigned, In Progress, Approved).'=>'編輯者不需要對工作流程帖子（已分配、進行中、已批准）具有狀態特定的編輯能力。','If enabled, non-Editors will need to be granted editing access via the "Permissions" screen.'=>'如果啟用，非編輯者需要通過“權限”屏幕授予編輯訪問權限。','If enabled, a Visibility Status dropdown will appear in Quick Edit for easy status assignment.'=>'如果啟用，快速編輯中將出現可見性狀態下拉選單以便捷分配狀態。','If enabled, this will add Visibility Statuses support to the PublishPress Status plugin.'=>'如果啟用，這將為 PublishPress Status 插件添加可見性狀態支持。','Post property or meta field to match with user field'=>'帖子屬性或元字段以匹配用戶字段','User property or meta field to match with post field'=>'用戶屬性或元字段以匹配帖子字段','User meta field to match with post field'=>'用戶元字段以匹配帖子字段','User role to include in synchronization'=>'要包含在同步中的用戶角色','Parent id for created posts'=>'創建的帖子的父 ID','Choose post field from suggested meta key names'=>'從建議的元鍵名稱中選擇帖子字段','When a new user of specified role is added, create or designate a post for them.'=>'當新增指定角色的新用戶時，為他們創建或指定一個帖子。','Create or designate a post for existing users.'=>'為現有用戶創建或指定一個帖子。','This post type is not hierarchical'=>'此帖子類型不是階層式的','Automatically create a post for each user in selected roles.'=>'自動為所選角色中的每個用戶創建一個帖子。','Hint: If %s have custom fields (like email address), create one to assist field name discovery.'=>'提示：如果 %s 有自定義字段（如電子郵件地址），請創建一個以協助字段名稱的發現。','Enable each user to edit their own User Posts.'=>'允許每個用戶編輯他們自己的用戶帖子。','Settings for replacing unreadable content with teaser text, provided by the %s module.'=>'用於用 %s 模組提供的預告文本替換不可讀內容的設置。','Settings on this tab do not apply because teaser filtering is disabled for all post types.'=>'此選項卡上的設置不適用，因為對所有文章類型禁用了預告過濾。','Since some browsers will cache feeds without regard to user login, block RSS content even for qualified users.'=>'由於某些瀏覽器會緩存不考慮用戶登錄的供稿，即使對於合格的用戶也會阻止 RSS 內容。','This feature controls what users will see when trying to view content they are blocked from accessing.'=>'此功能控制用戶在嘗試查看他們被阻止訪問的內容時將看到的內容。','These settings adjust which views, link types and visibility statuses the teaser is applied to.'=>'這些設置調整預告應用於哪些視圖、鏈接類型和可見性狀態。','You can override Teaser settings within the Nav Menu by hiding links to unreadable posts that are associated with the terms you select below.'=>'您可以通過隱藏與您在下面選擇的條款相關的不可讀文章的鏈接，來覆蓋導航菜單中的預告設置。','Keep unreadable content hidden in the blogroll and link lists, but show the teaser on direct access attempts.'=>'在博客滾動和鏈接列表中保持不可讀內容隱藏，但在直接訪問嘗試時顯示預告。','Hide unreadable private posts, but show a teaser for posts which are unreadable due to regular Privacy or Role Restrictions.'=>'隱藏不可讀的私人文章，但顯示由於常規隱私或角色限制而不可讀的文章的預告。','If anyone tries to view a post they don\'t have access to, redirect to another post instead of displaying a teaser.'=>'如果任何人嘗試查看他們無法訪問的文章，則重定向到另一篇文章，而不是顯示預告。','Replace post content or excerpt with custom text, possibly including an inline login form. You can also add text before or after the post title and excerpt.'=>'用自定義文本替換文章內容或摘錄，可能包括內聯登錄表單。您還可以在文章標題和摘錄之前或之後添加文本。','Unreadable items of these comma-separated types will have nav menu item hidden.'=>'這些以逗號分隔的類型的不可讀項目將隱藏導航菜單項目。','Visibility Circle membership does not limit viewing access.'=>'可見性圈成員身份不限制查看訪問。','Editorial Circle membership does not limit editing access.'=>'編輯圈成員身份不限制編輯訪問。','When searching for users via Permissions ajax, return return only users registered to current site'=>'在通過權限 ajax 搜尋用戶時，只返回註冊到當前網站的用戶。','If user is a super admin or has \'pp_manage_network_members\' capability, user searches via Permissions ajax return users from all sites'=>'如果用戶是超級管理員或具有 \'pp_manage_network_members\' 權限，則通過權限 ajax 搜尋的用戶將返回所有網站的用戶。','Count users as a member of a BuddyPress Permissions Group only if they are a moderator of the BP group'=>'僅當用戶是 BP 群組的版主時，才將其計算為 BuddyPress 權限組的成員。','Count users as a member of a BuddyPress Permissions Group only if they are an administrator of the BP group'=>'僅當用戶是 BP 群組的管理員時，才將其計算為 BuddyPress 權限組的成員。','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for all hierarchical post types) based on user\'s association permissions'=>'CMS 頁面樹視圖插件：根據用戶的關聯權限隱藏 \'添加\' 鏈接（適用於所有層次文章類型）。','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for pages) based on user\'s page association permissions'=>'CMS 頁面樹視圖插件：根據用戶的頁面關聯權限隱藏 \'添加\' 鏈接（適用於頁面）。','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for specified hierarchical post type) based on user\'s association permissions'=>'CMS 頁面樹視圖插件：根據用戶的關聯權限隱藏 \'添加\' 鏈接（適用於指定的層次文章類型）。','Prevent Permission from filtering the Nested Pages listing at all'=>'防止權限完全過濾嵌套頁面清單','Force Permissions to filter the Nested Pages listing'=>'強制權限過濾嵌套頁面清單','Comma-separated list of roles that are allowed to Quick Edit nested pages'=>'允許快速編輯嵌套頁面的角色，逗號分隔的角色清單','Comma-separated list of roles that are allowed to use the Context Menu'=>'允許使用上下文選單的角色，逗號分隔的角色清單','Never allow unfiltered users to use the Context Menu, even if they have pp_force_quick_edit capability'=>'即使用戶擁有 pp_force_quick_edit 能力，也絕不允許未過濾的用戶使用上下文選單','Disable Add Child link unless user is unfiltered (Administrator or has pp_nested_pages_unfiltered capability)'=>'除非用戶未過濾（管理員或擁有 pp_nested_pages_unfiltered 能力），否則禁用新增子項鏈接','Disable Add Child Page link unless user is unfiltered'=>'除非用戶未過濾，否則禁用新增子頁面鏈接','Disable Insert Page Before link unless user is unfiltered'=>'除非用戶未過濾，否則禁用在前插入頁面鏈接','Disable Insert Page After link unless user is unfiltered'=>'除非用戶未過濾，否則禁用在後插入頁面鏈接','Disable Push to Top link unless user is unfiltered'=>'除非用戶未過濾，否則禁用推送到頂部鏈接','Disable Push to Bottom link unless user is unfiltered'=>'除非用戶未過濾，否則禁用推送到底部鏈接','Disable Clone link unless user is unfiltered'=>'除非用戶未過濾，否則禁用克隆鏈接','License'=>'授權','License Key'=>'授權金鑰','Version'=>'版本','settings'=>'設置','Key Expired'=>'金鑰已過期','Deactivate Key'=>'停用金鑰','Key Activated'=>'金鑰已啟用','(please enter publishpress.com key)'=>'（請輸入 publishpress.com 金鑰）','Activate Key'=>'啟用金鑰','Note: Renewal does not require deactivation. If you do deactivate, re-entry of the license key will be required.'=>'注意：續訂不需要停用。如果您確實停用，則需要重新輸入許可證金鑰。','Your license key has expired. For continued priority support, %1$splease renew%2$s.'=>'您的授權金鑰已過期。為了繼續享有優先支援，%1$s請續訂%2$s。','Your license key will expire today. For updates and priority support, %1$splease renew%2$s.'=>'您的授權金鑰今天將會過期。為了獲得更新和優先支援，%1$s請續訂%2$s。','Your license key (for plugin updates) will expire in %1$d day(s). For updates and priority support, %2$splease renew%3$s.'=>'您的授權金鑰（用於插件更新）將在 %1$d 天內過期。為了獲得更新和優先支援，%2$s請續訂%3$s。','For updates to Permissions Pro, activate your %1$sPublishPress license key%2$s.'=>'要更新 Permissions Pro，請啟用您的 %1$sPublishPress 授權金鑰%2$s。','reload module info'=>'重新載入模組資訊','Permissions Pr