ls'=>'顯示更多詳細資訊','BuddyPress Group'=>'BuddyPress 群組','BP Permission Group'=>'BP 權限群組','BP Permission Groups'=>'BP 權限群組','Manage'=>'管理','BuddyPress Groups'=>'BuddyPress 群組','Page creation was blocked because you are not allowed to select that parent page.'=>'頁面創建被阻止，因為您不允許選擇該父頁面。','Back to Dashboard'=>'返回控制面板','Permission Denied'=>'權限被拒絕','You are not allowed to select that parent page.'=>'您不允許選擇該父頁面。','Network Groups'=>'網絡群組','Network Group'=>'網絡群組','Teaser text'=>'預告文本','Network'=>'網絡','Groups'=>'群組','Forum Teaser'=>'論壇預告','Network-wide groups'=>'整個網絡的群組','Teaser Topics'=>'預告主題','Hide Topic / Reply Author Link'=>'隱藏主題 / 回覆作者連結','Compatibility Pack'=>'相容性套件','Topic Teaser Text (%s):'=>'主題預告文本 (%s):','Reply Teaser Text (%s):'=>'回覆預告文本 (%s):','First Reply'=>'第一次回覆','Other Replies'=>'其他回覆','Not Logged In'=>'未登入','Logged In Users'=>'已登入的用戶','Insert a login form by using %s[login_form]%s shortcode.'=>'使用 %s[login_form]%s 短代碼插入登錄表單。','Hide Topics and Replies'=>'隱藏主題和回覆','Tease Topics and Replies'=>'戲弄主題和回覆','Show Topics, Tease Replies'=>'顯示主題，戲弄回覆','The single forum teaser may be customized by STYLESHEETPATH/press-permit/teaser-content-forum.php'=>'單一論壇的戲弄內容可以通過 STYLESHEETPATH/press-permit/teaser-content-forum.php 進行自定義','[This topic requires additional permissions or membership.]'=>'[此主題需要額外的權限或會員資格。]','[...]'=>'[...]','[This topic requires site login.]'=>'[此主題需要網站登入。]','[login required]'=>'[需要登錄]','[This reply requires site login.]'=>'[此回覆需要網站登入。]','File Access'=>'檔案存取','File Access Reset Key:'=>'檔案存取重設金鑰：','Small Thumbnails Unfiltered'=>'小縮圖未過濾','Make Unattached Files Private'=>'將未附加的檔案設為私人','Make Attached Files Private'=>'將附加的檔案設為私人','%1$sNote%2$s: Direct access to uploaded file attachments cannot be filtered because mod_rewrite is not enabled on your server.'=>'%1$s注意%2$s：由於您的伺服器未啟用 mod_rewrite，無法過濾直接訪問上傳的檔案附件。','%1$sNote%2$s: Direct access to uploaded file attachments will not be filtered due to your nonstandard UPLOADS path.'=>'%1$s注意%2$s：由於您的非標準 UPLOADS 路徑，無法過濾直接訪問